/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7ed72f31/D17/2/code.py:44:  - The checkerboard uses exactly two colors, not an arbitrary texture family.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7ed72f31/D17/2/code.py:45:  - Sprite colors are forbidden from matching either checkerboard color.
